                                        <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Mendengarkan rekaman diskusi & ceramah audio.</span>
                                    </label>
                                    <label class="border border-slate-200 hover:border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-3 flex flex-col cursor-pointer bg-slate-50/50 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all text-xs">
                                        <input type="radio" name="q1" value="K" class="mb-2 text-brand-600 focus:ring-brand-600" onchange="updateDiagnostic()">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Simulasi Langsung</span>
                                        <span class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Mencoba latihan koding dan studi kasus nyata.</span>
                                    </label>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Q2 -->
                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <label class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 block">
                                    2. Ketika Anda diminta mengingat poin-poin penting esai, Anda lebih suka:
                                </label>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
